Sacrament was a group led by the angel [[People/Samael|Samael]] that served the Patchwork Prince, [[Divinity/Unknown Entities/Mephistopheles|Mephistopheles]], as its god. It massacred a gathering of nobles in [[Geography/Ushas/Sigil|Sigil]], sparing only the party that would found [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]]. Its plan was to kill all three of the [[Divinity/Higher Kind|Higher Kind]] of [[Geography/Ushas/index|Ushas]] and so destroy the crystal sphere, loosing all its life force at once and giving Mephistopheles the power to ascend beyond what he was. Samael killed Ruin with a golden needle before the party destroyed Sacrament.
